DexSwapModule_Fork
├── setup
│   ├── it should deploy module with immutable router (Uniswap V3)
│   ├── it should fund PaymentRails with WETH, USDC, and DAI
│   └── it should return SWAP as moduleType
├── simulate WETH → USDC
│   ├── given PaymentRails configured for WETH → USDC via executeAction
│   │   ├── it should succeed
│   │   ├── it should decrease PaymentRails WETH by sell amount
│   │   ├── it should increase PaymentRails USDC within expected range
│   │   └── it should leave module with zero WETH and zero USDC
│   └── given direct module call from PaymentRails
│       ├── it should return success with correct outputToken
│       └── it should match amountOut to actual balance diff
├── simulate USDC → WETH
│   └── given PaymentRails configured for USDC → WETH via executeAction
│       ├── it should succeed
│       ├── it should receive WETH
│       └── it should decrease PaymentRails USDC by sell amount
├── simulate DAI → USDC
│   └── given PaymentRails configured for DAI → USDC via executeAction
│       ├── it should succeed
│       ├── it should receive USDC within 1:1 range
│       └── it should decrease PaymentRails DAI by sell amount
├── validation on mainnet
│   ├── given valid params with oracle feeds
│   │   └── it should return true
│   ├── given zero sell amount
│   │   └── it should return false with "Zero sell amount"
│   ├── given zero target token
│   │   └── it should return false with "Zero target token"
│   ├── given same input and output token
│   │   └── it should return false with "Same input and output token"
│   ├── given missing sell token price feed
│   │   └── it should return false with "Missing sell token price feed"
│   └── given missing buy token price feed
│       └── it should return false with "Missing buy token price feed"
├── oracle slippage — mainnet Chainlink feeds
│   ├── it should confirm all feeds are responding with positive prices
│   ├── it should estimate WETH→USDC output in realistic range
│   ├── it should estimate USDC→WETH output in realistic range
│   ├── it should estimate DAI→USDC output near parity
│   └── it should validate WETH→USDC with reasonable slippage
├── oracle slippage — mainnet swap with oracle enforcement
│   ├── it should succeed WETH→USDC with output >= oracle floor
│   ├── it should succeed DAI→USDC with output >= oracle floor
│   └── it should succeed direct module call with oracle enforcement
├── no residual state
│   ├── given a successful swap
│   │   └── it should leave module with zero sellToken and zero buyToken
│   └── given three consecutive swaps
│       └── it should leave module with zero balances after each
└── lifecycle
    ├── given deploy → configure → swap → swap
    │   ├── it should execute both swaps successfully
    │   ├── it should decrease WETH by total sold
    │   ├── it should receive reasonable total USDC
    │   └── it should leave module with zero balances
    ├── oracle-protected lifecycle
    │   ├── it should read and display oracle prices
    │   ├── it should validate before executing
    │   ├── it should receive output >= oracle floor
    │   └── it should leave module clean after swap
    └── it should log simulation results
